     1→# FreeLang v2.1.0 API Reference
     2→
     3→> 완전한 FreeLang v2 API 문서
     4→
     5→## 목차
     6→
     7→1. [Lexer & TokenBuffer](#lexer--tokenbuffer)
     8→2. [Parser](#parser)
     9→3. [AST & Analyzer](#ast--analyzer)
    10→4. [Compiler Pipeline](#compiler-pipeline)
    11→5. [Type Inference](#type-inference)
    12→6. [Pattern Database](#pattern-database)
    13→7. [CLI Interface](#cli-interface)
    14→
    15→---
    16→
    17→## Lexer & TokenBuffer
    18→
    19→FreeLang의 어휘 분석 계층입니다.
    20→
    21→### `Lexer` 클래스
    22→
    23→```typescript
    24→import { Lexer } from './src/lexer/lexer';
    25→
    26→const lexer = new Lexer(source: string);
    27→const tokens = lexer.tokenize(): Token[];
    28→```
    29→
    30→**메서드:**
    31→- `tokenize()`: 소스 코드를 토큰 배열로 변환
    32→- `getTokenAt(offset)`: 특정 위치의 토큰 조회
    33→
    34→**반환 토큰:**
    35→```typescript
    36→interface Token {
    37→  type: TokenType;
    38→  value: string;
    39→  offset: number;
    40→  length: number;
    41→  line: number;
    42→  column: number;
    43→}
    44→
    45→enum TokenType {
    46→  KEYWORD, IDENTIFIER, NUMBER, STRING,
    47→  OPERATOR, DELIMITER, COMMENT, EOF
    48→}
    49→```
    50→
    51→### `TokenBuffer` 클래스
    52→
    53→```typescript
    54→const buffer = new TokenBuffer(tokens: Token[]);
    55→```
    56→
    57→**메서드:**
    58→- `peek(offset?: number)`: 현재 토큰 조회 (consume 안 함)
    59→- `next()`: 다음 토큰으로 이동
    60→- `consume(expected?: TokenType)`: 토큰 소비 및 검증
    61→- `at(index)`: 특정 인덱스의 토큰 조회
    62→- `isAtEnd()`: EOF 여부 확인
    63→
    64→---
    65→
    66→## Parser
    67→
    68→구문 분석 및 AST 생성입니다.
    69→
    70→### 주요 함수
    71→
    72→#### `parseMinimalFunction(source: string): FunctionDef`
    73→
    74→최소 문법의 함수를 파싱합니다.
    75→
    76→```typescript
    77→import { parseMinimalFunction } from './src/parser/parser';
    78→
    79→const func = parseMinimalFunction(`
    80→  fn sum(arr: array<number>)
    81→    array.fold(0, |acc, x| acc + x)
    82→`);
    83→
    84→// 결과:
    85→// {
    86→//   name: 'sum',
    87→//   params: [{ name: 'arr', type: 'array<number>' }],
    88→//   returnType: 'number',
    89→//   body: [...]
    90→// }
    91→```
    92→
    93→#### `parseExpression(source: string, context?: ParserContext): Expression`
    94→
    95→표현식을 파싱합니다.
    96→
    97→```typescript
    98→const expr = parseExpression("arr.map(|x| x * 2)");
    99→```
   100→
   101→---
   102→
   103→## AST & Analyzer
   104→
   105→추상 구문 트리 및 의미 분석입니다.
   106→
   107→### `SemanticAnalyzer` 클래스
   108→
   109→```typescript
   110→import { SemanticAnalyzer } from './src/analyzer/semantic-analyzer';
   111→
   112→const analyzer = new SemanticAnalyzer();
   113→const analyzed = analyzer.analyze(ast: ASTNode, context: AnalysisContext);
   114→```
   115→
   116→**반환값:**
   117→```typescript
   118→interface AnalysisResult {
   119→  valid: boolean;
   120→  types: Map<string, Type>;
   121→  patterns: Pattern[];
   122→  errors: SemanticError[];
   123→  warnings: string[];
   124→  metadata: {
   125→    complexity: number;
   126→    requiresAsync: boolean;
   127→    memoryEstimate: number;
   128→  };
   129→}
   130→```
   131→
   132→### `ContextTracker` 클래스
   133→
   134→변수 및 타입 컨텍스트를 추적합니다.
   135→
   136→```typescript
   137→import { ContextTracker } from './src/analyzer/context-tracker';
   138→
   139→const tracker = new ContextTracker();
   140→tracker.pushScope();
   141→tracker.defineVariable('x', { type: 'number', mutable: true });
   142→const def = tracker.lookupVariable('x');
   143→tracker.popScope();
   144→```
   145→
   146→---
   147→
   148→## Compiler Pipeline
   149→
   150→코드 생성 및 컴파일 파이프라인입니다.
   151→
   152→### `PipelineCompiler` 클래스 (Phase 2)
   153→
   154→```typescript
   155→import { PipelineCompiler } from './src/compiler/pipeline-compiler';
   156→
   157→const compiler = new PipelineCompiler();
   158→const result = compiler.compile(code: string, options?: CompileOptions);
   159→```
   160→
   161→**옵션:**
   162→```typescript
   163→interface CompileOptions {
   164→  target?: 'c' | 'ts' | 'js';
   165→  optimizations?: 'none' | 'basic' | 'aggressive';
   166→  emitDebugInfo?: boolean;
   167→  strictMode?: boolean;
   168→}
   169→```
   170→
   171→**결과:**
   172→```typescript
   173→interface CompileResult {
   174→  success: boolean;
   175→  code: string;
   176→  ir: IR;
   177→  ast: ASTNode;
   178→  stats: CompilationStats;
   179→  errors: CompileError[];
   180→  warnings: string[];
   181→  debugInfo?: DebugInfo;
   182→}
   183→```
   184→
   185→### IR 생성
   186→
   187→```typescript
   188→interface IR {
   189→  version: string;
   190→  functions: IrFunction[];
   191→  constants: IrConstant[];
   192→  metadata: {
   193→    sourceLines: Map<number, number>;
   194→    optimization: OptimizationInfo;
   195→  };
   196→}
   197→
   198→interface IrFunction {
   199→  id: string;
   200→  name: string;

